{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56260","headline":"歌 · 郑奕","name":"歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫传读得五车书，莫言文似马相如。\n不如家有一镒金，一囊珠，可以赂相公之子弟，结相公之僮奴。\n便可朝爲屠沽，夕乘轩车。\n（见《类说》卷二七《外史檮杌》。\n末云：「词多不备载。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑奕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}